DATA DIVISION.
01 WORD-INDEX PIC 9 USAGE R0.
01 FIELD-OFFSET PIC 9 USAGE R1.
01 NEW-VALUE PIC 9 USAGE R2.
01 TEMP PIC 9 USAGE R3.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE 3 TO WORD-INDEX.
    MOVE 32 TO NEW-VALUE.
    PERFORM ALTER-WORD.
    EVAL.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.
ALTER-WORD.
    # Enforce Auncient memory alteration state mapping using literal integers
    SET depth 3.
    SET abductive 32.
    EXIT.
END-STRATEGY.
